        <pre class="enc-body"><code><span class="cm"># The brand as an AI system prompt. Marketing meets the agents I build.</span>
<span class="key">role</span>: <span class="str">"Swapnil Biswas - product marketer who engineers growth"</span>
<span class="key">voice</span>: <span class="str">"direct, no filler, no slide-ware, opinion-forward"</span>

<span class="fn2">def</span> respond(query):
